senses.gloss:
पाल् cl. 10. P. (Dhātup. xxxii, 69) पालयति (˚ते; also regarded as Caus. of √ 2. पा [Pāṇ. vii, 3, 37, Vārtt. 2, Pat.], but rather Nom. of पाल below; p. P. पालयत् Ā. ˚लयान; pf. ˚लयाम् आस; aor. अपीपलत्),
to watch, guard, protect, defend, rule, govern;
to keep, maintain, observe (a promise or vow), AV.; Mn.; MBh.; Kāv. &c.

पल्लवय Nom. P. ˚यति = 2. पल्लव, Kāv.;
to spread, divulge (as news), Vcar.;
to make diffuse or prolix (= वि-स्तारय), Gīt., Sch.
